{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52275","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兴生市郭儿，从头市内坐。\n例有百余千，火下三五个。\n行行皆有铺，铺里有杂（一作「新」）货。\n山鄣买物来，巧语能相和。\n眼勾稳物着，不肯遣放过。\n意尽端坐取，得利过一倍（此字失韵）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}